<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Product bundles</h2>
<p>Decide whether each message provides required order service or promotes an optional bundle. Record the permission or other applicable basis for its purpose and channel; a purchase or SMS opt-in does not by itself authorize email marketing. Recheck current permission, suppression, order, inventory, ownership and case state before dispatch, including messages already queued.</p>
