<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>No documented marketing permission</td><td>Hold optional bundle promotion until eligibility is established; send required service under its applicable basis</td><td>Service eligibility does not grant promotional permission</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>Offer relevant component education within the recorded purpose and channel</td><td>Permission alone does not establish compatibility or stock</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Check recovery eligibility and current cart state before a reminder</td><td>A cart event alone is not permission to send</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Exit recovery for the matching cart or order; reassess ownership before later eligible bundle suggestions</td><td>A purchase should stop obsolete recovery without blocking needed care</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Pause conflicting promotion and route required case service separately; reassess after resolution</td><td>Case closure alone does not restore marketing permission</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Review reliable clicks, purchases, complaints and a documented sunset policy</td><td>Non-opens alone do not reliably establish inactivity</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Verify its purpose, region, quiet hours, caps and current withdrawal state separately</td><td>SMS permission does not transfer to email</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Verify recipient role, purpose and applicable channel eligibility</td><td>An account relationship is not blanket promotional permission</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Use address validity, permission and abuse evidence; do not reject a free domain alone</td><td>Domain type alone does not establish consent or deliverability</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Exclude test profiles from production audiences and measurement</td><td>Internal activity can distort program metrics</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>Apply the same documented eligibility rules</td><td>Inferred identity does not override permission</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Hold promotion while checking available evidence; seek repermission only through an independently permitted route</td><td>A request for consent is itself a message requiring eligibility</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
